OL,3,GNEWSAPolice carrying out random
OL,4,Aroadside eyesight checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are carrying out random stops on
OL,7,Fdrivers in Cheshire to check their
OL,8,Feyesight meets the legal standard.
OL,10,FCheshire Police is taking part in
OL,11,FOperation Insight, a national road
OL,12,Fsafety initiative to improve road
OL,13,Fsafety through raising awareness of
OL,14,Fvulnerable road users and the
OL,15,Fimportance of being fit to drive.
OL,17,FRoadside vision screenings on motorists
OL,18,Fof all ages began on Monday and will
OL,19,Fcontinue until 8 November.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
