OL,3,GNEWSAPolice carrying out random
OL,4,Aroadside eyesight checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Cameron Taylor, Cheshire
OL,7,FPolice's head of roads and crime, said:
OL,8,F"Our message is simple: if you drive,
OL,9,Fmake sure your eyesight is checked
OL,10,Fregularly and that you wear any
OL,11,Fcorrective lenses you need."
